@startuml
title Invoice Workflow — Single-Service Deployment View (v3)
skinparam shadowing false

node "User device" as Client {
  artifact "Browser" as Browser
}

node "Application host" as Host {
  node "One FastAPI application process" as App {
    component "HTTP + static UI" as HTTP
    component "Application/domain modules" as Core
    component "Run-scoped in-memory EventBus" as EventBus
    component "Persistence adapters" as Persistence
    component "Document/PDF adapter" as Documents
    component "Third-party PDF library" as PdfLib <<library>>
  }
}

database "Persistent database" as Database
folder "Controlled document storage" as Storage

Browser --> HTTP : client-server requests
HTTP --> Core : in-process use cases
Core --> EventBus : in-process choreography triggers
Core --> Persistence : transactions and queries
Core --> Documents : bounded document operations
Persistence --> Database : definitions, invoices, runs,\napprovals, attempts, notifications, trace
Documents --> Storage : generated identities only
Documents --> PdfLib : open/readability/page checks

note right of App
Orchestration and choreography share this process.
Restart recovery reads persistent cursors.
EventBus holds no waiting state.
end note

note bottom of Storage
No original filename selects a path.
No OCR, AI extraction, or external document service.
end note

note "Absent: Kafka, ZooKeeper, distributed broker,\nmicroservices, external workflow engine,\npayment/accounting system, external email." as Exclusions

legend
Exact host, database engine, paths, volumes, and migration are later decisions.
This is deployment design, not deployment evidence.
endlegend
@enduml
